<p>Are you curious about something you heard about an event, place or person from Mandan's past? Place your question in the guestbook on the [HOME]/[Welcome] page, or submit to the Society at info@mandanhistory.org - otherwise some tidbits and factoids not yet deserving of a webpage (or buried among the historical tidbits within the Mandan Timeline webpages) will be posted here. Note: Answers will not be attempted for living residents, topics or issues relating to "current events." After all, this is a webpage from a historical society...</p>

